    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, we tender eligibility is determined by we average 3-year revenue and SOA classification OG3 classifica IV, with a maximum contract value eligibility of 3 million euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Since the total contract value for this contract is also 3 million euros over 4 years, we are financially eligible to bid." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To estimate our projected margin on this contract, let's consider the target gross margin percentage from we pricing model, which is 28%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without specific details on the costs associated with this contract, such as personnel, infrastructure, and other expenses, we can't accurately calculate the target gross margin percentage from our pricing model, which is 28%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nonetheless, if we were to achieve the target gross margin percentage from our pricing model, which is 28%, we projected profit on a 3 million euro contract would be 840,000 euros over a 3 million euro contract duration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It's also important to note that we minimum acceptable margin percentage is 18%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "If we were to operate at 18% due to competitive pressures or other factors, we projected profit would be 540,000 euros over this contract 4-year term." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these considerations and the requirement to optimize costs without sacrificing quality, we will need to carefully manage we expenses to ensure we meet the client's expectations while achieving an acceptable margin for we." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client seeks an artificial intelligence solution that assists agents in agents daily missions, improves the quality of answers, reduces processing times, and facilitates access to information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy can we propose to meet these requirements, ensuring compatibility with a daily use by agents and providing recommendations or proposals that can be explained?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we can propose an artificial intelligence solution that leverages we expertise in large language models (LLMs) and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities. we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, can be fine-tuned to improve the quality of answers and reduce processing times. we can also utilize we experience with LoRA and QLoRA fine-tuning methods to adapt Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct to the client's specific domain and tone." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To facilitate access to information, we can implement a RAG system that integrates with existing information systems, such as business software, civil status, town planning, and electronic management of documents. we vector stores experience, including Qdrant, Weaviate, pgvector, and FAISS, can be used to efficiently store and retrieve relevant information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure explainability and transparency, we can provide recommendations or proposals that can be explained using we XAI methods, such as source citation, chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME. we solution will also guarantee a high level of availability, with a typical response time of less than 2 seconds, and ensure compatibility with the client's existing system of information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of innovation strategy, we can propose a progressive deployment approach, starting with a pilot phase on a limited scope and gradually generalizing to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will allow we to test and refine Our solution, ensuring that Our solution meets the client's requirements and is compatible with the client's daily use. we typical V1 to V2 development cycle takes around 9 months, which can be adapted to the client's specific needs and timelines." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, we proposed AI components and innovation strategy aim to provide a reliable, efficient, and explainable artificial intelligence solution that assists agents in agents daily missions, improves the quality of answers, reduces processing times, and facilitates access to information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client aims to reduce The client environmental footprint and improve sustainable development." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
