        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can our proposed solution address these sustainability goals, and what green initiatives can our integrate into our offer?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can assure that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. is committed to reducing Nexus Engineering S.r.l. environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have already conducted a bilan carbone in 2023, which has helped Nexus Engineering S.r.l. understand Nexus Engineering S.r.l. carbon emissions, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. are working towards achieving net zero by 2040." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address these sustainability goals, our proposed solution can leverage Nexus Engineering S.r.l. existing green initiatives." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. partner with green hosting providers like OVHcloud and Scaleway, both of which use 100% renewable energy and have a high level of energy efficiency, as indicated by their Power Usage Effectiveness (PUE) of 1.3 and 1.28, respectively." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
